  :markdown
    This component can be used like this:

    ```haml
    :ruby
      Pokemon = import("./Pokemon")
    %Pokemon(id=123)
    ```

  %Details(lazy summary="Demo")
    .grid
      .scroll
        %Pokemon(id=123)

:css
  .grid { display: grid; }
